{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1763955,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"light-blue-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"Chem-E-Prix: NITR INNOVISION 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":947,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-08T12:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/chem-e-prix-nitr-innovision-2026-nit-rourkela-1763955","region":"hybrid","details":"<p>The <strong>Chem-E-Prix Preliminary Quiz<\/strong> is the qualifying round for the <strong>Chem-E-Car Competition at Innovision 2026, NIT Rourkela<\/strong>, organized by the <strong>AIChE NIT Rourkela Student Chapter<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>The quiz will challenge you across a diverse range of topics, including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chemistry<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>\ufe0f<strong>Physics<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Mathematics<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>General Science &amp; Logical Reasoning<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The competition is designed to test more than just your ability to remember formulas &mdash; <strong>conceptual understanding, logical thinking, and problem-solving<\/strong> will be key.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1lnh3mo\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"22\">Competition Journey<\/h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"15qh6uv\" data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"59\">Round 1: THE GRID (Online Quiz)<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"302\">\n<li data-section-id=\"wqz9sx\" data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"91\">Register your team on Unstop.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3ac0v\" data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"165\">Complete the online technical quiz on Unstop.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kjp8qv\" data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"203\">Test your knowledge of STEM topics.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"822f1l\" data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"259\">Only leader of the team needs to attend the quiz.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10vr1kx\" data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"302\">Qualifying teams move to the next round.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"khwvez\" data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"349\">Round 2: THE GARAGE (Abstract Submission)<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"625\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncd9pg\" data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"409\">Develop your chem-e-car concept and engineering approach.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cykpvv\" data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"455\">Prepare and submit your abstract on Unstop.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"80nbok\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"544\">Format and necessary details to be mentioned on the abstract will be given beforehand.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f958ax\" data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"625\">Selected teams advance to the Grand Finale to be held offline at NIT ROURKELA.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"n55741\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"664\">Round 3: THE GRAND PRIX (Car Run)<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"1011\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\n<li data-section-id=\"jbozmb\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"753\">Teams need to present their Chem-E-Car to the jury for safety check and run. (offline)<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11oi3eo\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"833\">A poster of the chem-e-car should be presented along with the car. (Softcopy)<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dilwhd\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1011\" data-is-last-node=\"\">More details about the car run and poster presentation details will be shared through registered mail IDs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Team Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participate in teams of <strong>2&ndash;5 members<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>The <strong>top-performing teams in the preliminary quiz will qualify<\/strong> for the next stage.<\/li>\n<li>Qualified teams will get the opportunity to participate in the <strong>Chem-E-Prix Competition at Innovision 2026, NIT Rourkela<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Exciting prizes await the top performers!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>So gather your team, sharpen your concepts, and get ready to take on the challenge.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Think. Solve. Build. Race. <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>AIChE NIT Rourkela Student Chapter<\/strong><\/p>","overall_prizes":"Exciting prizes and goodies worth INR 20,000!","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":1150645,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-30T23:42:54+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-08T23:27:00+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"bR9Jmra","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":60,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":2,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-09-30 23:46:17","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":false,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/6ac6702e8e7b7_NIT_R.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/6ac6702e8e7b7_NIT_R.png","regnRequirements":{"id":2495562,"opportunity_id":1763955,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":5,"min_team_size":2,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-08T12:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-16T23:59:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":0,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"eligibility":"{\"sector\":[\"students\"],\"engineering\":[{\"course\":\"btech\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYe