>NIT Rourkela, funded by the Government of India, is one of the premier national level institutions for technical education in the country.<\/li>\n<li>Government of India has elevated the Regional Engineering College, Rourkela to a deemed university under the name of National Institute of Technology, Rourkela (NIT Rourkela).<\/li>\n<li>The main objective of the Institute is to produce quality engineers and scientists in graduate and post-graduate levels in various branches of engineering and science.<\/li>\n<li>The campus is situated at the eastern end of Rourkela steel city, beyond Sector-1 spread over an area of 262 hectares of land provided by the Government of Orissa.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Guiding Principles<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build an environment that is conducive to academic pursuit, nurturing creative thoughts and inculcating a spirit of inquiry.<\/li>\n<li>Promote the free exchange of knowledge and experience with others, while respecting each other&rsquo;s right to intellectual property.<\/li>\n<li>Ensure quality, speed, economy, and transparency in all spheres of our activities.<\/li>\n<li>Create a truly multicultural community and promote cultural bonding and teamwork among all.<\/li>\n<li>Provide the opportunity to every member of the Institute for achieving academic excellence, developing all-round personality and realizing his or her full potential.<\/li>\n<li>Adopt a state-of-the-art technology in all endeavors.<\/li>\n<li>Serving towards the society using the knowledge and expertise of the Institute.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","public_url":"c\/national-institute-of-technology-nit-rourkela-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-947","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/5d1ae8b52e7ac_NIT_R.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/5d1ae8b52e7ac_NIT_R.png","organisation_type":"3","wp_tag":690,"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/c\/national-institute-of-techno