=\"2,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">Team Leader<\/strong> is permitted to attempt this assessment using their registered Unstop account.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Assessment Overview:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Questions:<\/strong> 30 Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Duration:<\/strong> 25 Minutes<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Total Marks:<\/strong> 70 Marks<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sectional Structure &amp; Marking Scheme:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Section 1 (Questions 1 to 25) &mdash; Standard Tier:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">+2 Marks<\/strong> for each correct answer<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">-1 Mark<\/strong> for each incorrect answer<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><em data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,0,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recommended pace: 45 seconds per question<\/em><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Section 2 (Questions 26 to 30) &mdash; Advanced Scenario Tier:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,1,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">+4 Marks<\/strong> for each correct answer<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">-2 Marks<\/strong> for each incorrect answer<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><em data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recommended pace: 80 seconds per question<\/em><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unattempted Questions:<\/strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"2,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">0 Marks<\/strong> (No penalty for unanswered questions).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Navigation &amp; Time Rules:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Backtracking is Disabled:<\/strong> Once you answer or skip a question, you cannot revisit it. Make your choices decisively.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>Questions and answer choices are randomized for every participant.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Test Environment &amp; Integrity Guidelines:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2,4,1\">\n<li>\n<div>Ensure a stable internet connection and an uninterrupted browser environment before starting.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>Tab-switch detection and full-screen monitoring are actively tracked. Navigating away from the test window, opening new tabs, or minimizing the browser will trigger warnings and may result in immediate auto-submission or disqualification.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>In the event of a tie in total marks, the team that completed the assessment in the least total time will be ranked higher<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Final Authority:<\/strong> All decisions regarding eligibility, evaluation, authenticity, shortlisting, and final judgment rest solely 